      "problem": "$\\frac{1}{3}÷4=$",
      "worked_solution": "To divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's denominator by that whole number:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}÷4=\\frac{1}{3\\times 4}=\\frac{1}{12}\n$$",
